WEBVTT

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.170
There.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.530
That does it for the big cleanup.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.620
It went really quickly thanks to the 
young master's and Natsume's help.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.610
I know.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:26.290
I should prepare tea before 
they get home from shopping.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.840
Yes, who is it?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.800
Hey.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.030
M-Master...

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:31.550
<b>Episode 11:     It Must Have Always Been...</b>

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.950
So heavy...

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:33.480
Why did Lilith ask us to buy so much stuff?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.920
What are you complaining about?

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:39.420
You're the one who said you wanted to go 
shopping because you didn't want to clean.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.850
By the way...

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.800
Th-Thanks.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:53.050
I'm glad I came here.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.690
I got to see Lilith doing well...

00:02:55.690 --> 00:03:02.650
A-And thanks to you, I finally 
got to tell Lilith how I feel.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.820
You just told her what you wanted to tell her.

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.610
I didn't do anything.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:09.170
You did!

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:15.040
I always thought it was embarrassing 
to tell someone how you feel.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.330
So it was a shock to me.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:26.360
Once I get back to my mansion, I'm going to 
tell the person I love that I love them.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:29.770
I realized it's important 
to tell them properly.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:33.530
What? I thought you loved Lilith.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.170
Huh?!

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.650
I mean, I-I do, but...

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:43.870
The love I have for Lilith isn't the 
same as the love I have for my master.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.490
Oh, I get it.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.310
You love your master.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.560
Am I wrong?

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.690
You're not wrong, but...

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.530
There are different kinds of love.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:01.680
Like, love for your family, 
love for your friends...

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:05.880
A kid like you wouldn't understand.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.240
A-Anyway, it's getting cold.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.550
Let's hurry home.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.490
Thanks.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.090
You don't need to be so tense.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:26.330
I just came to see how you're 
doing, since I was in the area.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.100
Okay.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:31.620
I'm sorry you had to take 
care of Natsume, too.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.860
Oh, no.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.620
It's not a problem.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.360
Where is Natsume?

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:39.350
She's out shopping right now.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:40.980
I see.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.850
Is she assisting you well?

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:43.950
Yes.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.910
She's been a great help.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.930
With cleaning, with laundry...

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.040
I'm glad to hear it.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.730
Um, master...

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:07.970
I'm very sorry for causing trouble for others 
at the mansion due to my own selfishness.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.870
Don't worry about that anymore.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.570
Everyone understands.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:20.140
This is a nice mansion.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:20.930
Yes.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:24.450
And it's well-maintained.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.260
You do all this by yourself?

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.960
Yes.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.310
That's impressive.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:36.590
I can see that you truly care about 
this mansion, and about your master.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:43.470
Does it have to do with your past?

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:55.920
When I was little, my parents disappeared, 
and I was left without a home.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.880
I was passed around between 
relatives and acquaintances.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:09.210
No one wanted to give me a home until...

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:15.140
The young master's parents, who were 
close friends with mine, took me in.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.270
Here.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.340
It's herbal tea.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.490
I hope you like it.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:36.590
Go ahead.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.170
I can make you a late-night 
snack if you're hungry.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.160
You don't have to hold back.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:59.280
Lilith-kun, I know the agreement was that 
we would take care of you for half a year.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:04.890
But you're welcome to stay as long as you'd like.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.730
Wh-Why?

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.800
It's partly because of our 
gratitude toward your parents,

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.840
but most of all, it's because 
we don't want to abandon you.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.160
Is that not a good reason?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.870
Who are you?

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.980
U-Um...

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.480
What's wrong?

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.700
Why are you hiding your eyes?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:51.120
Because my eyes are creepy...

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.400
No, they're not.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.600
They're pretty.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:02.750
Your eyes sparkle like the stars.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:03.950
They're really pretty.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:18.420
The people of this mansion 
welcomed me like real family.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.930
Snowgoose Private Academy

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.930
Recruiting Its 53rd Class

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:27.500
About a year in, I decided I wanted to 
go to a boarding school for servants.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:34.790
They were worried, but they understood 
my wish, and allowed me to study there.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.670
I studied my hardest, 
vowing to repay them someday.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:47.180
After I graduated, I was set 
to work at your mansion.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.650
And...

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.620
N-No...

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:57.840
That's when I received the news that the 
young master's parents had died in an accident.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:04.400
I saw him in the same light as I saw 
myself when I lost my parents.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.280
It was my turn to protect him.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.610
Along with this mansion.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.030
We're home.

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.930
We finally made it.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.010
Hey, listen to this, Lilith.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.170
Natsume's...

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.710
Would you go inside already? 
This stuff's heavy.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:45.040
Welcome home, young master, Natsume.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.640
Natsume, mind your tone.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:50.180
Wh-Why are you here?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.750
Because you weren't coming home.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.400
I was worried.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.620
Y-You didn't have to come get me.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:02.620
I was about to come home soon anyway.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.120
Lilith, who's this?

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:13.670
This man is the master of the 
mansion that I worked at previously.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.130
Nice to meet you, Yuuri-kun.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.570
N-Nice to meet you.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.690
Why...

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.600
Young master?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.980
Lilith is my maid!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.760
I'm not letting anyone take her!

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:29.730
Young master...

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.400
It's all right, Yuuri-kun.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.720
I'm not going to take her back with me.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.850
Don't worry.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.710
R-Really?

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:44.600
Yes.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.700
Well, I'd better get going.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.730
Natsume, get ready, please.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:58.810
Fine.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.920
Thanks for taking care 
of Natsume, Yuuri-kun.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.360
Not at all.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.230
I was the one who took care of him.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.420
Now, now, Natsume.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:20.450
Also, please be good to 
Lilith going forward, too.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.740
I will.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:31.790
Well, then...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.970
Master...

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.370
Thank you.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:43.630
May we come visit again sometime?

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.450
I'm sure Natsume will be missing you, too.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.680
Hey!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.370
Yes.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.650
Is that all right, young master?

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.410
Yeah.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.870
Please come whenever you'd like.

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.200
Thank you.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.350
They're gone.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:05.600
Yeah.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.510
Wh-What? What's wrong?

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.820
I made dinner for three.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.620
Oh, that's all? You scared me.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.480
What shall I do?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.890
I'll eat it.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:23.620
I can eat as much of your 
delicious cooking as you make.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.840
It's kind of quiet, isn't it, young master?

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.760
Yeah.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:41.640
I didn't realize it would be so much 
quieter without Natsume here.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.920
Yeah, it is.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.810
It hasn't been just the 
two of us for a while.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.550
Kind of exciting, isn't it?

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.290
Yeah.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.710
Young master, would you like some more?

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.830
Yeah. Please.

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.890
<i>It's been too long since it's 
been just the two of us.</i>

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.010
<i>I've forgotten how to converse properly.</i>

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:23.650
<i>But there's so much I need to tell him...</i>

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:30.970
Here you go.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:32.780
Thanks.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.000
Young master...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.260
Would you like to go out tomorrow?

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:44.940
I just realized we hadn't 
gone out together yet.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.690
Y-You mean a date?!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.760
Da—

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.680
Um...

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.390
Yes, a date.

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:56.650
All right.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:58.240
We're going on a date tomorrow!

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:08.570
It's gotten so cold.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.550
Yeah.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.530
Are you not cold, young master?

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.190
Not at all.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.450
Especially since you gave me this.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.440
Is something the matter?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.650
Your clothes...

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.960
I dressed up the best I could.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.740
It's my first date with you, after all.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.230
Just kidding.

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:35.200
Yeah.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.630
You look beautiful.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.220
Thank you.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.350
Where shall we go, young master?

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.350
Let's see...

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.460
I'd like to go wherever you'd like to.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.870
We can go anywhere.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.200
But...

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:56.620
Anything is fun if I'm with you.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:03.120
Wh-Why don't we stop by 
a café for some hot cocoa?

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.440
Yeah, good idea.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.590
Shall we, then?

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.830
What's the matter, young lady?

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.910
Why do I have so many lessons 
when it's the holiday season?

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:22.740
You just have to get through today.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.000
And then you're going on vacation 
overseas with your parents.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.700
Yuuri-san?!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.020
Hey, Fujisaki, look at that.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.460
Do you think...

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.010
That's a d-date, isn't it?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.450
It is, isn't it?!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.670
No, I'm pretty sure they're just shopping.

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:41.740
What are you talking about?!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:42.750
Look at them!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.510
They're having so much fun!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.390
We can't just sit here.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:48.830
Let's follow them, Fujisaki.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:49.860
We will not.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.870
You have piano lessons.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.910
I don't care about—

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.390
Young lady.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:09.150
It warms you up, huh?

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:11.960
Yeah.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:17.420
It looks like it might snow 
if it gets any colder.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:18.950
Snow, huh?

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.670
Hey, Lilith...

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:25.440
Yes?

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:29.260
There's somewhere I want to go after this.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:30.300
Is that all right?

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.100
Yes, of course.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.240
So where is it that you'd like to go?

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.900
I was afraid to come here by myself.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:01.690
Young master...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.840
But now, with you here, 
I could finally do it.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:05.830
Thanks.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:11.680
Mom and Dad are doing well 
together in Heaven, right?

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.010
Yes, of course.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:18.530
The two of them are watching over you.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:22.450
Yeah.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.700
You're right.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.080
Don't worry.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.320
I have Lilith. I'm all right.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.910
Well, I'll be back again.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:44.780
Master, Madam, it's been a while.

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:45.830
It's Lilith.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.950
Don't worry about the young master.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.030
I'll take care of him.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.470
Lilith?

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:55.700
Yes, I'm coming.

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.530
It's so pretty.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:09.090
Yeah.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.190
Is something the matter?

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:22.160
You looked so pretty, gazing at the lights.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.820
I couldn't help but gaze at you.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:29.640
I-I'm sorry for having all the fun.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.210
Not at all.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.710
I'm having fun, too.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:38.250
Besides, it's been a long time 
since I've had you to myself.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.180
I-I'm always your maid.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.160
You were busy with Natsume 
until just recently.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.900
You had no time for me.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.270
Th-That's right.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:56.730
So I realized we have to cherish 
the time we have together more.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.580
Because I love you, Lilith.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:20.230
There's something I've been 
wondering this whole time...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:25.340
What kind of "love" do you mean 
when you say you love me?

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:33.910
I don't know.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:40.100
But I want to find out 
going forward, with you.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:51.770
Remember when you asked me if I was only 
by your side because you're my master?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:52.540
Yeah.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:20:01.210
When I'm with you, I feel so happy 
that my face turns beet red.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.650
And my chest warms up.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:09.220
I want to be by your side not because 
you're my master, but because you're you.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:14.590
I don't know yet if I can 
respond to your love.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.940
But I adore you all the same.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.760
Thanks!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:32.620
<i>It must have always been 
that way, ever since back then.</i>

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:45.580
<i>And from now on, too.</i>

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:52.440
<i>I hope you continue to love me, 
even after you know everything about me.</i>

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:59.350
Well, the snow is getting heavier.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:01.300
Let's go home, young master.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.350
You're right.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.190
<i>For now, that's all I want to wish for.</i>

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.870
It's really piled up.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.270
<i>I know.</i>

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>I'm going to make a snowman 
to surprise Lilith.</i>

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:32.150
<i>Oh, she already made one.</i>

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.220
Young master?

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:47.460
My.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:50.260
You made a snowman, too.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.130
Yeah.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.240
Huh?

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:55.050
That one...

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.890
They're so cute next to each other.

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:04.150
They look just like you and me.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:05.040
Yeah.

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.360
Aren't they cute?

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:09.590
I'm going to make kids for them, too.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:11.040
K-Kids?!

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:12.920
Lots of them!

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:15.920
<i>Lots?!</i>

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:21.250
They're cute.

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:25.110
It's gotten cold.

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:30.980
Your hands are all red.

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:33.280
You're right.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:34.630
Allow me.

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.210
I'll warm some water.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:52.600
Y-Young master?!

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:54.560
Your hands are freezing, too.

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:56.890
You mustn't, young master.

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:58.520
Y-You'll get cold.

00:22:59.330 --> 00:23:00.490
Will I?

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:01.860
You will.

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:09.200
It's starting to feel warm.

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:15.970
A-Anyway, let's go inside, young master.

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:18.160
All right, Lilith.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.990
Thank you for watching!

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.990
<b>Illustration: Kombu Wakame</b>
